==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|когда́-то}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-когда-то.ogg}}

===Adverb===
{{ru-adv|[[когда́]][[-то]]}}

# [[once]] (upon a time), [[formerly]]; ''constructions with'' [[used to]]
#: {{syn|ru|когда́-нибудь|не́когда}}

====Usage notes====
* The particle {{m|ru|-то}} imparts a sense of indefiniteness similar to English [[some]]. The form '''когда-то''' is usually associated with affirmatives (like [[sometime]]), while {{m|ru|когда́-нибудь}} is associated with questions and negatives (like [[anytime]]).

